      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MULITALO MAGIC (5) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (20.11) at Goulburn over 350m. Expected to feature in the finish again. SCREAMING DEMON (7) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when seventh at Bulli over 340m behind No Spark Left (19.91) in a Grade 5. Should be in this for a long way. OVERINDULGE (4) goes very well this course and distance starting five times for two wins and three minors. Comes off a (17.86) win last time, scoring by 2.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 324m at this track. Can feature with the right run. IRON CONDOR (1) is worth including.",
